Chemical & Mathematical Notation Loss:
Edexcel 4CH1 papers rely heavily on subscripts, equilibrium arrows (⇌), oxidation states, and thermochemical cycles. Traditional PDF parsers parse stream operators—they see text strings, not semantics. They routinely miss subscripts or turn them into normal inline characters, which breaks your RAG evaluation when an answer requires Cu 
